      "clause_id": "CLAUSE-DOC023-1",
      "clause_number": "1",
      "title": "Scope",
      "content": "Scope: This Indian Standard (IS 14543 : 2024) covers and specifies requirements for Packaged Drinking Water (Other Than Packaged Natural Mineral Water) - Specification (Third Revision). It applies to packaged_drinking_water under drinking_water category in the food_agriculture domain.",
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
